### Está de pé?
GET http://localhost:3001/health

### Listar a fila
GET http://localhost:3001/inscricoes

### Entrar na fila
POST http://localhost:3001/inscricoes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Carla Dias",
  "email": "carla@exemplo.com"
}

### Faltando campo: responde 400
POST http://localhost:3001/inscricoes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Sem e-mail"
}

### E-mail repetido: responde 409
POST http://localhost:3001/inscricoes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Ana de novo",
  "email": "ana@exemplo.com"
}
